  "headline": "FDA's records trace our atenolol supply to a plant classified OAI 6237 days before the posting",
  "headline_cites": ["E5", "E15"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "The atenolol products at Corvale East, Corvale General, and Corvale Lakeside all carry the same NDC 71335-1535-1 and are labeled by Bryant Ranch Prepack (FEI 1000519407).",
      "cites": ["E1", "E2", "E3", "E15"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 590126 of that plant ended on 2009-06-11 and was classified Official Action Indicated (OAI) with a known date of 2009-09-09.",
      "cites": ["E5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "That OAI classification occurred 6237 days before the current posting date of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["E5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Subsequent inspections in 2010, 2011, 2013, 2016, 2019, 2022, 2024, and 2026 were all classified Voluntary Action Indicated (VAI).",
      "cites": ["E6", "E7", "E8", "E9", "E10", "E11", "E12", "E13"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A Warning Letter was issued to the plant on 2010-04-08.",
      "cites": ["E14"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East has only 6 days of atenolol on hand while Corvale Lakeside holds 25 days and can transfer 35 units to bring Corvale East to approximately 8 days of supply.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D3"]
    }
  ]
}
